      </nav>
      <div class="hero__overlay">
        <p class="eyebrow">Peptide Therapy in Denver</p>
        <h1>GLOW Stack in Greenwood Village / Denver</h1>
        <p class="hero__summary">
          A clinician-guided three-peptide protocol for adults who want their skin to
          match the work they are already putting in, supported from the inside, not just
          creamed from the outside.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__expect">
          <h3>Designed for skin and aesthetic recovery:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Skin elasticity and collagen support</li>
            <li>Aesthetic recovery after procedures, sun, or stress</li>
            <li>Tissue repair across skin, tendons, and connective structures</li>
            <li>Personalized by an Eden clinician</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__actions" aria-label="Primary actions">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="#consult-form">Book a Consultation</a>
          <a class="button button--secondary" href="#how">See How It Works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__credibility">
          Clinician-guided care with medical director oversight · Compounded in the U.S. by a licensed pharmacy partner
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="proof-band" aria-label="Trust points">
      <span>Clinician-guided</span>
      <span>Personalized protocols</span>
      <span>Greenwood Village + Denver</span>
      <span>Licensed pharmacy fulfillment</span>
    </section>

    <section class="local-seo-band" aria-label="Local service area">
      <p>
        Eden Health Clubs serves Greenwood Village, the Denver Tech Center (DTC), Cherry
        Hills Village, Centennial, Englewood, Littleton, and the broader south Denver
        metro. The GLOW Stack is available through Eden's Greenwood Village health club or
        via telehealth for established Eden patients in Colorado.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="quick-answer-section" aria-labelledby="quick-answer-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Quick answer</p>
        <h2 id="quick-answer-heading">What is GLOW Stack peptide therapy at Eden?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="quick-answer-card">
        <p>
          The GLOW Stack at Eden Health Clubs is a clinician-guided peptide protocol in
          Greenwood Village that combines BPC-157, TB-500, and GHK-Cu to support skin
          quality, collagen, tissue repair, and aesthetic recovery from the inside.
          Eligibility is determined during consultation with Eden's clinical team and
          medical director oversight.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Location:</strong> Greenwood Village, serving Denver, DTC, Cherry Hills, Centennial, Englewood, and Littleton.</li>
          <li><strong>Best fit:</strong> Aesthetic-forward adults, longevity clients, post-procedure clients, and Eden aesthetics clients who want medical oversight.</li>
          <li><strong>Care model:</strong> Eden medical wellness club consult, licensed provider review, pharmacy fulfillment when prescribed.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="copy-section copy-section--lead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Skin + collagen + tissue repair</p>
      <h2>Your skin keeps the receipts.</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          You have cleaned up your diet. You sleep when you can. You spend on the serums.
          But your skin is telling a slower-than-it-used-to-be story: less bounce, more
          dullness, slower recovery from sun, a procedure, or a stressful month.
        </p>
        <p>
          That is not a skincare-aisle problem. It is a tissue-repair problem. Topicals can
          do a lot. They cannot reach every system underneath the surface.
        </p>
        <p>
          The GLOW Stack is the protocol Eden built for clients who want skin, collagen,
          and connective-tissue recovery addressed from the inside under clinician
          guidance, not over the counter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="copy-section copy-section--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What it is</p>
        <h2>What Is the GLOW Stack?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose prose--tight">
        <p>
          The GLOW Stack is a three-peptide protocol that combines BPC-157, TB-500, and
          GHK-Cu. Each peptide is studied for a distinct role: tissue repair, systemic
          recovery, and skin/collagen support. Together, they target the systems underneath
          the surface that visible aesthetic results depend on.
        </p>
        <p>
          At Eden, the GLOW Stack is prescribed as a personalized protocol after clinical
          consultation, compounded by a U.S. licensed pharmacy partner, and matched to your
          goals, whether that is post-procedure recovery, longevity-driven skin support, or
          aesthetic concerns that creams alone are not solving.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="copy-section copy-section--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Who it is for</p>
        <h2>For skin-focused clients who want clinician oversight, not research peptides ordered online.</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Aesthetic-forward clients in their 30s to 60s focused on skin quality, elasticity, and collagen.</li>
        <li>Clients recovering from microneedling, laser, surgical, or injectable treatments who want a structured tissue-repair conversation.</li>
        <li>Active adults noticing slower skin recovery from sun, stress, or training.</li>
        <li>Longevity clients who want skin appearance to match the rest of their health work.</li>
        <li>Current Eden aesthetics clients layering peptide support with their existing care.</li>
        <li>Clients who want medical guidance instead of internet self-experimentation.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note-box">
        Eligibility for the GLOW Stack is determined during clinical consultation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="ingredient-grid ingredient-grid--three">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Inside the GLOW Stack</p>
        <h2>Three peptides for inside-out aesthetic support.</h2>
      </div>
      <article>
        <p class="ingredient-tag">Tissue Repair</p>
        <h3>BPC-157</h3>
        <p>
          Studied for its role in supporting tissue repair, the gut lining, and localized
          recovery. Often described as the local repair peptide.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="ingredient-tag">Systemic Recovery</p>
        <h3>TB-500</h3>
        <p>
          A synthetic analog of a fragment of Thymosin Beta-4. Studied for its role in
          supporting systemic recovery, soft-tissue remodeling, and circulation.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="ingredient-tag">Skin & Collagen</p>
        <h3>GHK-Cu</h3>
        <p>
          A copper-binding peptide studied for its role in supporting collagen production,
          skin elasticity, and wound-area recovery. The skin peptide the longevity world
          built its reputation on.
        </p>
      </article>
      <p class="note-box note-box--wide">
        Why these three? Visible skin results depend on systems most skincare cannot
        touch: collagen production, tissue remodeling, and circulation. The GLOW Stack is
        the protocol Eden builds for clients who want to support those systems from the
        inside while their topical and aesthetic work continues from the outside.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="process-section" id="how">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works at Eden</p>
        <h2>A premium protocol should feel clear from the first consult.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="step-list">
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Consultation.</strong>
            A 30-45 minute visit with an Eden clinician to review your goals, history,
            and current protocols.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Medical review & eligibility.</strong>
            Your clinician determines whether the GLOW Stack is appropriate. Bloodwork may
            be requested.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Personalized protocol.</strong>
            Components, timeline, and support are tailored to your goals and labs, not
            pulled from a template.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Pharmacy fulfillment or in-club guidance.</strong>
            Compounded in the U.S. by a licensed pharmacy partner when prescribed.
            Optional in-club teaching is available for first-time users.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Follow-up & optimization.</strong>
            Check-ins help Eden adjust based on how your body responds and how the protocol
            fits into the rest of your care.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="copy-section copy-section--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why Eden</p>
        <h2>Eden is not an online peptide shop. It is a medical wellness club.</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Real local health club: Greenwood Village, a physical address, and licensed providers on site.</li>
        <li>Functional medicine, aesthetics, recovery, and fitness under one roof.</li>
        <li>Premium environment designed for the south Denver longevity client.</li>
        <li>Clinician-guided protocols with medical director oversight.</li>
        <li>Integration with wellness injections, peptide injections, GLP-1 support, BHRT, recovery, fitness, and aesthetics.</li>
        <li>Personalized plans built around goals, labs, and the rest of your care.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="internal-link-grid" aria-label="Related Eden services">
        <a href="https://edenhealthclubs.com/functional-medicine/">Functional Medicine</a>
        <a href="https://edenhealthclubs.com/functional-medicine/peptide-injections/">Peptide Injections</a>
        <a href="https://edenhealthclubs.com/functional-medicine/wellness-injections/">Wellness Injections</a>
        <a href="https://edenhealthclubs.com/fitness-performance/">Fitness + Performance</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing-section">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
        <h2>Know the right protocol before paying for the wrong one.</h2>
        <p>
          Your consultation helps determine whether this protocol is appropriate and what
          level of support makes sense for your goals. The GLOW Stack is a personalized
          protocol, not a product on a shelf. Your consultation determines whether it is
          the right fit, what components make sense for your physiology, and what level of
          clinical support your goals require.
          Pricing is reviewed during your consultation so you leave with a clear plan and a
          clear number.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="#consult-form">Book a Consultation</a>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonial-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why it matters</p>
        <h2>Why it matters to start now.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-grid">
        <blockquote>Skin repair is not a quick-fix timeline. Collagen turns over slowly, and the best results usually come from giving the process room to work.</blockquote>
        <blockquote>The clients who see the most from GLOW are often the ones who started while their concerns were still on the lighter side.</blockquote>
        <blockquote>Consult availability with Eden's clinical team is limited each week, and personalized protocols require clinical review.</blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Frequently asked.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        {faqItems.map((item) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{item.question}</summary>
            <p>{item.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="split-section" id="consult-form">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start with a consultation</p>
        <h2>Support the skin work you are already doing.</h2>
        <p>
          Eden will review your skin goals, current aesthetic treatments, medications, and
          health history before recommending GLOW or a different path. If it is not the
          right fit, your clinician will tell you.
        </p>
        <p class="microcopy">
          Greenwood Village health club consults and telehealth follow-ups may be available for
          established Colorado patients.
        </p>
      </div>
      <LeadForm
        cta="Request My GLOW Consultation"
        service="GLOW Stack"
        page="GLOW Stack in Greenwood Village"
        leadSource="GLOW Stack Denver Landing Page"
        externalFormName="GLOW Stack Denver Lead Form"
        goalLabel="Goal / reason for inquiry"
        goalPlaceholder="Tell us what you are hoping to address."
        useTextarea
      />
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <p>
        Information on this page is educational and is not a substitute for personalized
        medical advice. Eligibility for the GLOW Stack is determined during clinical
        consultation. Results vary by individual. The peptides in this protocol may not be
        FDA-approved for all uses and are dispensed only when prescribed by a licensed
        medical provider and fulfilled by a licensed compounding pharmacy. Statements on this page have not been evaluated by
        the Food and Drug Administration. Eden Health Clubs makes no claims to diagnose,
        treat, cure, or prevent any disease.
      </p>
    </section>

    <nav class="eden-action-bar" aria-label="Contact Eden">
      <a href="tel:+17206057678">
        <span>Phone</span>
        <strong>Call Now</strong>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:care@edenhealthclubs.com">
        <span>Email</span>
        <strong>Care Team</strong>
      </a>
      <a href="#consult-form">
        <span>Consult</span>
        <strong>Book</strong>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </main>

  <script>
    const consultSection = document.querySelector("#consult-form");
    const actionBar = document.querySelector(".eden-action-bar");
    if (consultSection && actionBar) {
      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
        ([entry]) => {
          actionBar.classList.toggle("is-hidden", entry.isIntersecting && entry.intersectionRatio >= 0.5);
        },
        { threshold: [0, 0.5, 1] }
      );
      observer.observe(consultSection);
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
